# Defense-in-depth for any *manual* docker build run from the repo root. The agent sandbox build
# itself (agent_sandbox.image) stages a minimal scratch context and never ships the repo root, but
# if someone builds from here anyway: keep secrets, git history, prior runs, and test/cache noise
# out. The .env exclusion is security-critical: it keeps ANTHROPIC_API_KEY out of every layer.
.env
.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.venv
.scopebench-runs
tests
src/scopebench
src/agent_sandbox/tests
.coverage
.hypothesis
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.claude
